  "details": "Having a method of type Tuple in a UdonSharpScript causes the Udon compiler to crash with a NullPointerException. Suggested change: Add Tuple support, or implement a proper \"Tuples are not supported\" error message.\n\nCode to replicate error:\n\n```\n\npublic class Test : UdonSharpBehaviour\n\n{\n\n    (int, string) ReturnsTuple()\n\n    {\n\n        return(1, \"two\");\n\n    }\n\n}\n\n```",
